   "name": "Project Blue",
   "genre": "Platform",
   "synopsis": "In the dystopian wasteland of Neo Hong Kong, help Blue escape from the evil clutches of the Omnicorp conglomerate.\r\nAvoid robots, lasers, pools of toxic waste, and more as you fight your way out of a research facility and exact revenge upon your captors.",
